[statement]
apk keeps the installed `py` 3.12, and refuses, where the request's `lt` 22
needs `l22`, which states `py` and then `py~3.14`: the replaced `lt` 21
needed `py`, the installed `pypyc`'s condition names `py=3.12`, and
`l22pyc`'s condition names `l22=22` and `pypyc`. Without any one of these,
or with `l22` stating `py~3.14` alone, apk upgrades `py`. The shape of
`reduced/llvm-test-utils-is-refused-over-an-installed-python3-pyc`.
Observed; the rule is not yet known.

[repository]
P:lt
V:22
D:l22

P:l22
V:22
D:py py~3.14

P:l22pyc
V:22
i:l22=22 pypyc

P:py
V:3.14

[installed]
P:py
V:3.12

P:pypyc
V:3.12
i:py=3.12

P:lt
V:21
D:py

[request]
lt>21

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
| ERROR: unable to select packages:
|   py-3.12:
|     breaks: l22-22[py~3.14]
|     satisfies: l22-22[py]
refused
